175 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Beyond the ramparts, the Gulf stretches wide and forgiving. As the air cools, the city flows toward it \204 couples strolling, cyclists gliding, fishermen mending their nets in the amber light. The malec\363n hums with quiet joy, its breeze carrying the mingled scents of salt and roasted corn. The sea is Campeche\220s mirror and memory: calm, reflective, infinite. Every evening, it gathers the day\220s stories and returns them softened, gilded, and free.)/E(Beyond the ramparts, the Gulf stretches wide and forgiving. As the air cools, the city flows toward it \204 couples strolling, cyclists gliding, fishermen mending their nets in the amber light. The malec\363n hums with quiet joy, its breeze carrying the mingled scents of salt and roasted corn. The sea is Campeche\220s mirror and memory: calm, reflective, infinite. Every evening, it gathers the day\220s stories and returns them softened, gilded, and free.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

176 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 57 0 R/Pg 13 0 R/K[4]>>
