193 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(When the heat softens and the cathedral begins to glow, Campeche exhales. The streets stir with laughter, the scent of anafres drifts from corners, and families wander the malec\363n beneath the fading sky. The city changes pace \204 no rush, just a shared rhythm, easy and familiar. This is Campeche at its best: alive but unhurried, steeped in color, history, and warmth. As night gathers, every light feels like an invitation to stay a little longer.)/E(When the heat softens and the cathedral begins to glow, Campeche exhales. The streets stir with laughter, the scent of anafres drifts from corners, and families wander the malec\363n beneath the fading sky. The city changes pace \204 no rush, just a shared rhythm, easy and familiar. This is Campeche at its best: alive but unhurried, steeped in color, history, and warmth. As night gathers, every light feels like an invitation to stay a little longer.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

194 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(\215Campeche comes alive when the sun learns to rest.\216)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

