206 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(When lights bloom across the plaza, Campeche turns communal. Families stroll, musicians tune, and the cathedral\220s towers glow in amber and white. Sit with an ice cream or a tamarind drink, listen to the hum of evening life, and feel the balance of reverence and joy that defines the city after sunset.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

