212 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(By late morning, the malec\363n is pure rhythm \204 joggers tracing the water\220s edge, fishermen preparing boats, and the Gulf stretching like liquid glass. It\220s both boundary and invitation: the best place to feel how Campeche balances motion and stillness, where the sea becomes part of daily ritual.)/E(By late morning, the malec\363n is pure rhythm \204 joggers tracing the water\220s edge, fishermen preparing boats, and the Gulf stretching like liquid glass. It\220s both boundary and invitation: the best place to feel how Campeche balances motion and stillness, where the sea becomes part of daily ritual.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

