217 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Where the sea learns to dance.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

218 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(As night falls along the malec\363n, water and light take the stage. The Fuentes Marinas fountains rise and sway to music, each jet catching the glow of passing cars and the laughter of families gathered to watch. Children run close enough to feel the mist; couples pause mid-walk as colors shift from gold to indigo. It\220s simple, local, and completely unpretentious \204 a reminder that beauty doesn\220t always hide in temples or galleries. Sometimes it arcs into the sky, fades, and returns again, just for the joy of being seen.)/E(As night falls along the malec\363n, water and light take the stage. The Fuentes Marinas fountains rise and sway to music, each jet catching the glow of passing cars and the laughter of families gathered to watch. Children run close enough to feel the mist; couples pause mid-walk as colors shift from gold to indigo. It\220s simple, local, and completely unpretentious \204 a reminder that beauty doesn\220t always hide in temples or galleries. Sometimes it arcs into the sky, fades, and returns again, just for the joy of being seen.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

