227 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Along a busy avenue near the airport, a plain fa\347ade hides something rare. Step through the unmarked doorway and the city falls away. Inside, Casa Mayis feels private and purposeful\204part home, part sanctuary. Ceremonial cacao, intuitive massage, and guided meditation are offered without schedule or signage, only by those who listen for calm. Every ritual is personal, shaped to restore balance rather than impress. It\220s the kind of place that finds you when you\220re ready: still, warm, and deeply human.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

