333 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Journaling keeps a journey alive. Writing slows experience to the pace of awareness \204 helping memory settle, meaning surface, and curiosity expand. Each note you make becomes a breadcrumb for your future self, or for someone yet to arrive.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

334 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The Maya world has no single route. Every traveler moves differently \204 guided by rhythm, curiosity, or chance. This guide offers pieces of a mosaic, not a map to follow. Where you go, what you find, and how you connect become part of a story that others will one day read. In Maya Tuya, the Maya is yours \204 and your journey shapes the next.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

335 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Plan in your own rhythm)/Pg 21 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

336 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(There\220s no template for travel, only inspiration. Just as your route is yours to create, so is the way you prepare for it. We don\220t dictate how you plan \204 we simply offer a few sparks to help you think clearly, travel confidently, and tread lightly. Use whichever prompts speak to you, and write them out in the blank pages that follow.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

